data: {"id": "f0b04d638e514391-thinking-parallel_evidence-975", "run_id": "f0b04d638e514391", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n1.  **当前状态**: Pod 仍处于 `Pending`，`app` 容器处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `ImagePullBackOff`。Prometheus 指标 (`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`) 和 kubectl describe 结果一致，**未恢复**。\n2.  **Events 核心错误**: `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` -> `failed to resolve reference` -> `dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`。\n3.  **拓扑关系**: Pod 由 `Deployment/aiops-case-02/workload` -> `RS/workload-65b7f54794` 控制；调度在 `node2` 上；容器名为 `app`。\n4.  **可观测性数据**", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788766252431, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "f0b04d638e514391-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "f0b04d638e514391", "seq": 976, "ts_ms": 1788766257576, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 29.43, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/f0b04d638e514391-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8a11752ade956cd8cb465dbb2b5bbe6687020e3fbe4680b6d3a78f620a0a3950", "bytes": 2634}, "snapshot_sha256": "8b52a6181c84bcc0a19ec1a10c016a566edfc774d32b7504547861709fcb0349"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

