data: {"id": "f0b04d638e514391-final", "run_id": "f0b04d638e514391", "seq": 980, "ts_ms": 1788766265185, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod 配置使用了无效的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`，导致 kubelet 在尝试拉取镜像时 DNS 解析失败（`no such host`），从而引发 `ImagePullBackOff`。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning  Failed ... Error: ImagePullBackOff` | 指示容器启动受阻的直接症状 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": rpc error ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供具体的 DNS 解析失败错误，锁定根因为无效镜像域名 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: ImagePullBackOff) | 从监控视角确认当前状态为 ImagePullBackOff |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.memory=8Mi`, `container.resource_limit.memory=32Mi` | 排除因资源不足导致的启动失败（资源配置处于合理范围） |\n| 5 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending`, `container.restart_count: 0` | 确认容器尚未成功拉起，且无重启尝试记录，符合刚配置错误镜像的特征 |\n\n证据内容总结：\nKubernetes 事件与 Metric 均一致指向 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。最关键的证据（事实 #2）明确指出 Docker/kubelet 在尝试连接 `registry.invalid` 时遭遇 `no such host` 错误，证实了镜像地址配置错误是根本原因。资源配置和重启次数等状态排除了其他潜在因素。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n无效镜像域名 \"registry.invalid\" 配置 → DNS 解析失败 (no such host) → kubelet 镜像拉取错误 → ImagePullBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 配置了无效的镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`。\n\n根据事实 #2，kubelet 尝试拉取 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 时，底层网络请求在解析域名阶段失败（`lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`）。这直接导致容器处于等待状态，并触发 `ImagePullBackOff` 事件（事实 #1, #3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.8s\n├─ 问题定位: 16.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 29.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 29.4s (Evidence 24.3s, RCA 5.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 53.759, "metrics": {"run_id": "f0b04d638e514391", "mttr": {"value": "53.8s", "seconds": 53.764463901519775, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 53764.463901519775, "llm_calls": 9, "llm_duration_ms": 49641.3676738739, "tool_calls": 7, "executed_tool_calls": 7, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 7, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9272.609949111938, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3824.1024017333984}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16716.30072593689, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发